            <ArticleTitle>Synovial abrasion for isolated, partial thickness, undersurface, medial meniscus tears.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>675-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Synovial abrasion and rasping provides good healing potential of isolated, partial thickness, undersurface medial meniscal tears. It is an effective, easy, and valuable treatment modality.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
